{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_03",
  "title": "挤压",
  "storyCode": "DM-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b1bd90ea9d3ea4efca1a5d94dd4028255dafd50891a107951ba355265016d407",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些萨卡兹都停下了。\n燃烧着的废墟向中心挤压过来，那些怪物一样的敌人居高临下。\n在这场包围中心的，是一个突兀出现的女性，一个......古怪的人。\n她不是萨卡兹，但是就那么只身站在战场的正中心，面不改色。\n伊内丝在颤抖，我可猜不出她是为了什么颤抖。\n听力似乎因为爆炸稍有受损，我听不清他们在说什么。\n但是我知道，他们在畏惧。\n是因为面前这个人吗？\n不是，所有人都看着另一个方向，都看着另一个人。\n在我失去意识的最后一秒，我看到了——\n一个......萨卡兹。\n毫无敌意的......纤细的萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他们......临时......\n萨卡兹......必须......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......你要......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的伤很重......如果我们不在这里作应急处理......\n......如果......他......会找到这里......我们没有时间......\n......凯尔希，来搭把手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......唉，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "这里是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "船上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "船......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......我们怎么还活着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你想自嘲能不能不要带上我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "总的来说，被救下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......那这里是哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "运输队本队，我们一直护送的就是这艘舰船，现在临时收纳了一些伤员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "看样子都是些正在搭建中的设施，真是不明白这艘船是什么构造，闻所未闻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "（但是那时候看见的影子，确实是......还是别深究了吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......赫德雷呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......他在和雇主......不，他在和......和这里的主人谈判。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "也对，既然你还愿意乖乖待在这里，那赫德雷肯定没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那么，这里的主人是怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你好像很紧张，我不需要你那种有害视力的源石技艺就能感觉到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......你不会以为，我待在这里真的是在关心你吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我想也不是，那是为了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "我现在，稍微有点可怜他了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "那间屋子里的，都是些什么妖魔鬼怪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "......你不用这么紧张，会影响到会议的效率。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "你们尽力做到了最好，而泄露了情报是我们的失误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......战场上无论对错，我很清楚我们在和谁作对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "可我没想到那位指挥官......原来真的是殿下身边的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "您的......那种力量也让我深感意外，我还没有为您出手相助正式道谢，凯尔希医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "谢特蕾西娅吧，是她的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "殿下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这里不是卡兹戴尔，不必多礼，我们坐下谈吧，赫德雷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......遵命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "那您身边的这位就是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "希望你不要介意，任何战略情报博士都必须了如指掌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "感谢理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（真的是一艘舰船......这个规模不算小了吧......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（有些设施看上去是全新的，有些地方又破旧的让人无法靠近......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（我记得......这是从雷姆必拓......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娇小的卡特斯",
      "text": "啊！抱、抱歉，这前面的设施还在施工......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娇小的卡特斯",
      "text": "凯尔希医生说过......不要随便去更深处的地方，会很危险......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "哼嗯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "好吧，那我就换条路吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娇小的卡特斯",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......真有礼貌啊，那双耳朵，果然不是萨卡兹吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "说起来，那个比伊内丝还讨人厌的女人，好像是个医生来着？也不是萨卡兹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "这里到底是怎么回事，明明身在战场的中心，尽是些萨卡兹之外的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怎么又卡住了啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "冷、冷静点，可露希尔，不过是今天的第七次短路——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "第——七——次——短——路——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "这对天才工程师来说是莫大的耻辱！要不要考虑重新买一批门！那样比较快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "诶......因为多出了许多伤员，他们的伙食也需要紧急采购，人手和预算方面都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "而且你就这么放弃，难道就不算耻辱了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "咕呜呜呜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "那么！殿下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "给我三天时间，三天！既然怎么都修不好，干脆把整个安保控制系统拆了重装！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "重、重装？可行吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "虽然不知道是谁造了这些不明所以的系统还埋在雷姆必拓地下深处，但既然弄不明白——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "——就把它替换成可以弄明白的！非常简单的道理！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......那，就交给你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "得令！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "罗德岛......还要很久才能投入使用吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "罗德岛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你是......我记得是和赫德雷一起的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你醒了吗？你之前伤的很重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（她刚才那算是被吓到了吗......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "佣兵W，我在找赫德雷队长，然后不小心迷路——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "侦查的时候要留神点，有些区域还在施工，电缆都裸露在外，小心触电。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不过这种程度的谨慎应该也算是你们雇佣兵的天性了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "W，是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "叫我特蕾西娅吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "赫德雷在会议结束后和博士聊了两句，现在应该已经回到临时病房了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "不要让同伴太担心，你也回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......特蕾西娅......殿下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "嗯？啊，这里不是卡兹戴尔，不必拘谨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那特蕾西娅......殿下为什么要在这儿和一堵门较劲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "刚才那个小个子是个工程师吧，这点小事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "这也不是件小事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "是......吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "有多少事是真的不值得去关注的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......那罗德岛是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "欸，你听见了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "是这艘船的名字，虽然还没有正式的命名仪式，我......想这么称呼它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "只是一厢情愿而已，说不定博士和凯尔希会反对用它的“本名”呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......哈，本名？这艘船的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "你也看见了，这艘船并非卡兹戴尔所制造。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "在最深处，尚且残留下的资料里，我翻阅到了这个名字......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "“罗德岛”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "我也不知道这到底意味着什么，嗯......凯尔希应该懂得多一些吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "但我想这么命名它。既然它已经有了名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（和篡夺卡兹戴尔的摄政王分庭抗礼......几乎凭一己之力重新统合了大半萨卡兹门阀的特蕾西娅殿下......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（正在亲自修复一扇断了电的自动门？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "你怎么了？表情有点奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "在殿下面前笑出声来......算不算僭越？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "不，不算吧......不过凯尔希和博士都是不苟言笑的......战士们背负着很多，也不太容易敞开心扉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "如果可以的话，我倒希望你们都可以展露笑容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "但这是一种不负责任的奢望，我不能忽视压在大家身上的重担。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那我笑一会应该没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "呃，请？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不，这样我突然笑不出来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "总觉得是我的错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "呵呵......咳，不敢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "那你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "我是特蕾西娅，它是罗德岛，你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "“W”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "不是说那个，“W”只代表一个雇佣兵。你的名字才能代表你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "不要让这种沾满战火气息的伪装持续太久，不光是说名字，就算是我多管闲事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "啊......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "你没有自己的名字吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "对在卡兹戴尔出生的萨卡兹来说，这是件稀松平常的事情吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "很少有萨卡兹会这么在意......名字。被遗忘的速度太快，花力气去记住那么多人的本名是很没效率的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "我不想忘记他们，也不能忘记他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "如果等到卡兹戴尔的命运尘埃落定......等到你不再是“W”，而我们还有机会这样交谈的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "说不定你可以拥有一个更好的名字，更适合你这样的萨卡兹女性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "就像罗德岛一样，如果有个名字的话，听上去就温暖多了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我没想过这种......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "特蕾西娅，通讯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "卡兹戴尔有动作，博士已经在着手布置了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "嗯，我马上就去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "W？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啊，嗯，我在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "text": "如果你还愿意为我们而战，无论你那时在做什么，这里都随时欢迎你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "我不会对特蕾西娅的决定指手画脚，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "不要以为你会在这里大受欢迎，我看过你的全部履历，你很危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "呃，彼此彼此？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "......你的身体恢复得很快，但还远远没到可以随意闲逛的程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "回到你的病榻上去，否则会有人把你扛回去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "事后我才意识到。\n我从头到尾，都没敢正视特蕾西娅的眼睛。\n为什么呢。\n她看上去明明那么天真。\n根本不像是主持了这场残酷战争的领袖之一......\n天真......吗？\n但天真的人可不会有那种眼神......那种......悲伤的......\n......她的身边似乎总是环绕着那两个人。\n如果......我能和他们站在一起......\n我会看见什么样的风景呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（那个兜帽......是他们嘴里的“博士”？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（是不是看向这边了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（怎么回事......为什么......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（我在害怕？怕什么？他给人的感觉就是普通的......不，太模糊了，我没见过这样诡异的人......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（啊......巴别塔的战地指挥官，我好像想起来了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（“博士”，是吗。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我开始明白伊内丝为什么不敢靠近殿下了。\n也许我也该担忧一下，才是对自己好吧。\n但是......不知道为什么，啊，对于特蕾西娅的事情，我好像总是不知道为什么......\n就当是心血来潮吧，赫德雷他们会理解的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
